  "brief": { "zh": "在夜市抢购香料，得分超过每一台对手。每袋香料值一分。第 7 回合结束时三袋余货会搬到便桥两头的摊位。第 17 回合结束时两袋余货搬到东侧，河上的便桥换位。三台采购机器人会根据比分改变采购路线。货物售罄或第 37 回合结束时结算。", "en": "Finish the night market ahead of every rival. Each spice bag is worth one point. After turn 7 three unclaimed bags move to stalls at the two ends of the footbridge. After turn 17 two unclaimed bags move east and the footbridge changes position. Three shoppers adjust their routes as the scores change. The market closes when stock runs out or after turn 37." },
